326| * bare (`MODELS`), optional args wrapped in brackets (`[MODELS]`), and
327| * `multiple` args get a trailing ellipsis (`MODELS...`) so a required
328| * variadic reads as `MODELS...`, not the misleading optional `[MODELS]`.
